      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T21:04:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why 10? If it failed once, what are the chances that it works on any subsequent try? If the chance is very low, i.e. the failure was almost certainly due to a programming error, I wouldn\u0027t bother retrying. If the chance is not very low, can the failures be debugged?",
      "revId": "8dae8ec94a55b128e2c07f9b6bca8422a6a1129d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
